\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus lives! Thy terrors now
\par Can, O death, no more appal us;
\par Jesus lives! by this we know
\par Thou, O grave, canst not enthral us.
\par                                        Hallelujah!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus lives! to Him the throne
\par High o'er heaven and earth is given;
\par We may go where He is gone,
\par Live and reign with Him in heaven.
\par                                       Hallelujah!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus lives! for us He died;
\par Hence may we, to Jesus living,
\par Pure in heart and act abide,
\par Praise to Him and glory giving.
\par                                  Hallelujah!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesus lives! our hearts know well
\par Nought from us His love shall sever;
\par Life, nor death, nor powers of hell,
\par Part us now from Christ for ever.
\par                                 Hallelujah!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Jesus lives! henceforth is death
\par Entrance-gate of life immortal;
\par This shall calm our trembling breath
\par When we pass its gloomy portal.
\par                                 Hallelujah!
\par                                        \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

